Package: party.jailbreak.omega-ondevice
Name: Omega On-Device
Version: 1.4.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: Keeps sideloaded apps valid on-device. Backend worker that
 neutralises the local revocation state (OCSP cache + the four
 MobileIdentityData ban-lists, rewritten empty and locked immutable) and
 re-applies it at every boot. Drive it from the native Omega app, or it runs
 automatically on boot. Pair with a DNS block of ocsp/ppq/crl/valid.apple.com
 for the online side.
Author: jailbreak.party (on-device port)
Maintainer: Omega
Section: Tweaks
Depends: firmware (>= 15.0)
Tag: role::hacker
